 "Доска-ступенька из трёх столбиков высотой 2, 3 и 4 клетки": "<figure class=\"st\"><div style=\"display:flex;gap:3px;align-items:flex-end\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;align-items:center\"><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px dashed #2c394c;color:var(--muted)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px dashed #2c394c;color:var(--muted)\"></span><span style=\"font:12px var(--sans);color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px\">2 клетки</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;align-items:center\"><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px dashed #2c394c;color:var(--muted)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px dashed #2c394c;color:var(--muted)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px dashed #2c394c;color:var(--muted)\"></span><span style=\"font:12px var(--sans);color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px\">3 клетки</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;align-items:center\"><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px dashed #2c394c;color:var(--muted)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px dashed #2c394c;color:var(--muted)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px dashed #2c394c;color:var(--muted)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px dashed #2c394c;color:var(--muted)\"></span><span style=\"font:12px var(--sans);color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px\">4 клетки</span></div></div><div class=\"flab\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">девять клеток — и ровно девять цифр 0–8, каждая по разу</div><div class=\"flab\" style=\"margin-top:12px\"><span style=\"color:var(--gold)\">суммы столбиков равны</span> &nbsp;·&nbsp; внутри столбика цифры идут <span style=\"color:var(--blue)\">по возрастанию сверху вниз</span></div><figcaption>Столбики разной высоты, но сумма у всех одна — значит длинному достаются мелкие цифры, а короткому крупные; с короткого и начинай.</figcaption></figure>",
 "В доску из 3 строк и 9 столбцов": "<figure class=\"st\"><div style=\"display:inline-grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(9,34px);gap:3px;font:15px var(--mono)\"><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px solid transparent;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;font-family:var(--sans)\">1</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px solid transparent;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;font-family:var(--sans)\">2</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px solid transparent;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;font-family:var(--sans)\">3</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px solid transparent;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;font-family:var(--sans)\">4</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px solid transparent;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;font-family:var(--sans)\">5</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px solid transparent;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;font-family:var(--sans)\">6</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px solid transparent;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;font-family:var(--sans)\">7</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px solid transparent;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;font-family:var(--sans)\">8</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px solid transparent;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;font-family:var(--sans)\">9</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px dashed #2c394c;color:var(--muted)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px dashed #2c394c;color:var(--muted)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#3a2f18;border:1px solid #6b5320;color:var(--gold)\">7</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px dashed #2c394c;color:var(--muted)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px dashed #2c394c;color:var(--muted)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px dashed #2c394c;color:var(--muted)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px dashed #2c394c;color:var(--muted)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px dashed #2c394c;color:var(--muted)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px dashed #2c394c;color:var(--muted)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px dashed #2c394c;color:var(--muted)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px dashed #2c394c;color:var(--muted)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px dashed #2c394c;color:var(--muted)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px dashed #2c394c;color:var(--muted)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#3a2f18;border:1px solid #6b5320;color:var(--gold)\">9</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px dashed #2c394c;color:var(--muted)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px dashed #2c394c;color:var(--muted)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px dashed #2c394c;color:var(--muted)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px dashed #2c394c;color:var(--muted)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px dashed #2c394c;color:var(--muted)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px dashed #2c394c;color:var(--muted)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px dashed #2c394c;color:var(--muted)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px dashed #2c394c;color:var(--muted)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px dashed #2c394c;color:var(--muted)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px dashed #2c394c;color:var(--muted)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#3a2f18;border:1px solid #6b5320;color:var(--gold)\">8</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px dashed #2c394c;color:var(--muted)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px dashed #2c394c;color:var(--muted)\"></span></div><div class=\"flab\" style=\"margin-top:12px\"><span style=\"color:var(--gold)\">7</span> — верхняя строка, 3-й столбец &nbsp;·&nbsp; <span style=\"color:var(--gold)\">9</span> — средняя, 5-й &nbsp;·&nbsp; <span style=\"color:var(--gold)\">8</span> — нижняя, 7-й</div><div class=\"flab\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">любые три подряд — по горизонтали и по вертикали — дают 30</div><figcaption>Так доска выглядит до всякого счёта: перерисуй её себе крупно и подпиши каждое данное число, прежде чем искать период.</figcaption></figure>",
 "Уголок — фигурка из трёх клеток буквой Г": "<figure class=\"st\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:18px;align-items:flex-start\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;align-items:flex-start\"><div style=\"display:inline-grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,30px);gap:3px;font:15px var(--mono)\"><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px dashed #2c394c;color:var(--muted)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#12281c;border:1px solid #2b5c3d;color:var(--green)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#12281c;border:1px solid #2b5c3d;color:var(--green)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#12281c;border:1px solid #2b5c3d;color:var(--green)\"></span></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;align-items:flex-start\"><div style=\"display:inline-grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,30px);gap:3px;font:15px var(--mono)\"><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#12281c;border:1px solid #2b5c3d;color:var(--green)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px dashed #2c394c;color:var(--muted)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#12281c;border:1px solid #2b5c3d;color:var(--green)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#12281c;border:1px solid #2b5c3d;color:var(--green)\"></span></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;align-items:flex-start\"><div style=\"display:inline-grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,30px);gap:3px;font:15px var(--mono)\"><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#12281c;border:1px solid #2b5c3d;color:var(--green)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#12281c;border:1px solid #2b5c3d;color:var(--green)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px dashed #2c394c;color:var(--muted)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#12281c;border:1px solid #2b5c3d;color:var(--green)\"></span></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;align-items:flex-start\"><div style=\"display:inline-grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,30px);gap:3px;font:15px var(--mono)\"><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#12281c;border:1px solid #2b5c3d;color:var(--green)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#12281c;border:1px solid #2b5c3d;color:var(--green)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#12281c;border:1px solid #2b5c3d;color:var(--green)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px dashed #2c394c;color:var(--muted)\"></span></div></div></div><div class=\"flab\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">уголок — это квадрат 2×2, у которого <span style=\"color:var(--muted)\">одна клетка вырезана</span>; какая именно — это и есть его поворот</div><div class=\"flab\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">в задаче повороты считаются <b>разными</b> положениями</div><figcaption>Фигурка задаётся двумя вещами сразу: где стоит её квадрат 2×2 и какой угол у него пуст.</figcaption></figure>",
 "Заметь главное. Диагональ уже дала каждой строке": "<figure class=\"st\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:28px;align-items:flex-start\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;align-items:flex-start\"><div class=\"flab\" style=\"margin-bottom:8px\">заполнена только диагональ</div><div style=\"display:inline-grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,40px);gap:3px;font:15px var(--mono)\"><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:40px;height:36px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#3a2f18;border:1px solid #6b5320;color:var(--gold)\">1</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:40px;height:36px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#16263a;border:1px solid #3d5a82;color:var(--blue)\">3/4</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:40px;height:36px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px dashed #2c394c;color:var(--muted)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:40px;height:36px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px dashed #2c394c;color:var(--muted)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:40px;height:36px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px dashed #2c394c;color:var(--muted)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:40px;height:36px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#3a2f18;border:1px solid #6b5320;color:var(--gold)\">2</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:40px;height:36px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px dashed #2c394c;color:var(--muted)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:40px;height:36px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px dashed #2c394c;color:var(--muted)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:40px;height:36px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px dashed #2c394c;color:var(--muted)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:40px;height:36px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px dashed #2c394c;color:var(--muted)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:40px;height:36px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#3a2f18;border:1px solid #6b5320;color:var(--gold)\">3</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:40px;height:36px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px dashed #2c394c;color:var(--muted)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:40px;height:36px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px dashed #2c394c;color:var(--muted)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:40px;height:36px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px dashed #2c394c;color:var(--muted)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:40px;height:36px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px dashed #2c394c;color:var(--muted)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:40px;height:36px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#3a2f18;border:1px solid #6b5320;color:var(--gold)\">4</span></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;align-items:flex-start\"><div class=\"flab\" style=\"margin-bottom:8px\">кандидаты клетки (1, 2)</div><div class=\"flab\" style=\"margin-top:0px\"><span style=\"color:var(--red)\">не 1</span> — единица уже стоит в этой строке</div><div class=\"flab\" style=\"margin-top:0px\"><span style=\"color:var(--red)\">не 2</span> — двойка уже стоит в этом столбце</div><div class=\"flab\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">остаются <span style=\"color:var(--blue)\">3 и 4</span> — ровно две ветки</div></div></div><div class=\"flab\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">дальше выбора нет: как только в строке появилось второе число, два оставшихся расходятся по двум клеткам вынужденно — одно из них диагональ уже поставила в свой столбец</div><figcaption>Диагональ бьёт каждую пустую клетку сразу с двух сторон, поэтому кандидатов у неё не больше двух — и весь квадрат висит на одной-единственной развилке.</figcaption></figure>",
